  <div class=3D"hook">
    <span class=3D"badge">KASHMIR  &middot;  PEAK SUMMER 2026</span>
    <div class=3D"h1">The valley is green,<br>the peaks still <span class=3D"=
acc">hold their snow.</span></div>
    <div class=3D"bd">Down in the plains it is heavy and hot. Up here the mea=
dows are out, the last snow is bright on the ridgelines, and the Dal is cool =
and still at dawn. The whole valley is open and planned start to finish by pe=
ople who live here, so you just arrive.</div>
    <a class=3D"btn" href=3D"https://viakashmir.in/">Plan my Kashmir trip &ra=
