    <div class=3D"re">Open all season  &middot;  Houseboats, hotels, cabs &am=
p; shikaras sorted</div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"sp24"></div>
  <div class=3D"strip">This is the escape. Green meadows, snow still on the p=
eaks, and the Dal like glass at dawn while the plains bake.</div>
  <div class=3D"sp30"></div>
  <div class=3D"featimg"><img src=3D"cid:178347127763.10949.11137654291779711=
