:100%;height:300px;object-fit:cover;border:0;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;"></=
div>
  <div class=3D"featcap"><p class=3D"ft">Glide the Dal at first light</p><p c=
lass=3D"fl">Before the city wakes, a shikara slips across water so still it m=
irrors the sky. This is the Srinagar morning everyone remembers.</p></div>
